              Enhanced builds, plus long1 30059 frames IDENTICAL; dirt checked
              against the scenery at every blit, offset 0; 17/17 negatives
              detected; heli hand-made state: 2 blits differ, the original's
              rotor wrap; loading stub unchanged since its JNext check

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: Enhanced dirt moved with the scenery on
